         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The potential of at-home prediction of the formation of urolithiasis by simple multi-frequency electrical conductivity of the urine and the comparison of its performance with urine ion-related indices, color and specific gravity</rdf:li>
